# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository publishing (portfolio) exclusions
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Demonstration videos (~465 MB; two files exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit).
# Originally shipped only on the DVD attached to the printed thesis.
Docs/Videos/

# Generated Doxygen HTML — regenerate with `make docs`.
Docs/Trunk/

# Raw PPM result dumps under Docs/ and Report/ (~97 MB); PNG copies are kept.
# Scene textures under Source/ (e.g. Source/scenes/earth.ppm) are required and kept.
*.ppm
!Source/**/*.ppm

# Pre-built Windows binaries and bundled third-party DLLs.
# Excluded to keep the repository source-only and avoid redistributing
# GPL-licensed runtime libraries (cygwin1.dll, etc.). Build from source instead.
afr-compiled.zip
dlls.zip
